contentText:
What&#8217;s more difficult: singing &#8220;The Star-Spangled Banner&#8221; in front of millions or appearing on Hot Ones ? Charlie Puth &#8212; who performed the song at the 2026 Super Bowl &#8212; still isn&#8217;t sure.

